OL,3,CFather jailed for four months after
OL,4,Cabandoning children on island
OL,6,FA father has been jailed for four
OL,7,Fmonths after abandoning his children
OL,8,Fin Guernsey to go on a trip to the UK.
OL,10,FThe defendant, who is anonymised to
OL,11,Fprotect the children's identity,
OL,12,Fappeared at Guernsey Magistrate's
OL,13,FCourt on Thursday 6 August.
OL,15,FThe court heard that the father had
OL,16,Ftold his children he was going to buy
OL,17,FChristmas presents in December 2025.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G1/4
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
