PN,35402
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F354A1786128505
OL,3,CFather jailed for four months after
OL,4,Cabandoning children on island
OL,6,FHowever, he instead went to the UK to
OL,7,Fsource illegal substances for a
OL,8,Fserious drug habit and stayed there
OL,9,Ffor more than a week.
OL,11,FThe court heard that he left two
OL,12,Fchildren aged eight and 14 at home
OL,13,Fwith just #50 to feed themselves.
OL,15,FIt was also described that there was
OL,16,Fmouldy food in the kitchen, out-of-
OL,17,Fdate produce in the fridge, and rusty
OL,18,Fgarden shears left in the hallway.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G2/4
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BCh Is News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,355,350,120,260,000,100
PN,35403
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F354A1786128505
OL,3,CFather jailed for four months after
OL,4,Cabandoning children on island
OL,6,FIt was only by chance that family
OL,7,Fmembers found out what had happened,
OL,8,Fand jumped in to look after the
OL,9,Fchildren.
OL,11,FIn messages, the defendant joked that
OL,12,Fhe might extend his stay further
OL,13,Fbecause he would rather spend
OL,14,FChristmas on his own.
OL,16,FThe defendant was booked to return to
OL,17,FGuernsey on 19 December but missed his
OL,18,Fboat and came back on 22 December.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G3/4
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
