FL,355,350,120,260,000,100
PN,35404
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F354A1786128505
OL,3,CFather jailed for four months after
OL,4,Cabandoning children on island
OL,6,FHe told the court that his decision to
OL,7,Fleave was made because a prescription
OL,8,Fdrug he had been taking had been
OL,9,Fstopped and he was struggling through
OL,10,Fa rapid detox.
OL,12,FIn sentencing, Judge Graeme McKerrell
OL,13,Flambasted the fact he'd put his drug
OL,14,Fuse before his children's welfare,
OL,15,Fadding that to expect the children to
OL,16,Ffend for themselves was "simply
OL,17,Fwickedness".
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G4/4
